config*.py
!config.py
test_videos/*
!test_videos/.gitkeep
test_results.xlsx
**/__pycache__/**
logs/**
test.py
playlist.txt
# envs/*.py are tracked as skeletons (CHANGE_ME placeholders).
# After filling in real credentials, run:
#   git update-index --skip-worktree envs/base.py envs/dev.py envs/stage.py envs/prod.py
# This prevents accidental pushes of real secrets.
/envs/*.py
!/envs/__init__.py
!/envs/base.py
!/envs/dev.py
!/envs/stage.py
!/envs/prod.py